WEBVTT

1
00:00:10,220 --> 00:00:11,700
Mom, prepare something

2
00:00:11,900 --> 00:00:12,980
I have to go to Kaoshantun

3
00:00:13,810 --> 00:00:14,970
What are you doing in Kaoshantun?

4
00:00:15,450 --> 00:00:22,000
Robbery

5
00:00:22,200 --> 00:00:23,400
Son, are you okay?

6
00:00:23,640 --> 00:00:25,840
Thanks to Wang Zhiqiang’s help, I was able to escape safely today

7
00:00:25,840 --> 00:00:27,600
But I wonder if I will be unconscious at sea for a long time in the future.

8
00:00:27,720 --> 00:00:29,160
There will definitely be times like this in the future

9
00:00:29,160 --> 00:00:30,360
I had good luck today

10
00:00:30,360 --> 00:00:31,560
Something strange was discovered at the dock

11
00:00:31,680 --> 00:00:32,760
But if I hadn't discovered it at the time

12
00:00:32,760 --> 00:00:33,840
How about boarding the ship normally?

13
00:00:33,960 --> 00:00:35,320
Once the small wooden boat reaches the sea,

14
00:00:35,440 --> 00:00:36,440
I'll meet those people again

15
00:00:36,600 --> 00:00:37,880
That's just letting others slaughter you.

16
00:00:38,080 --> 00:00:39,680
I want to live a good life when I am reborn

17
00:00:39,840 --> 00:00:40,960
Don't want to die at sea

18
00:00:41,750 --> 00:00:43,430
You were right not to confront them head-on today.

19
00:00:44,070 --> 00:00:45,870
Although we have a machete on our boat,

20
00:00:46,110 --> 00:00:48,110
But that thing is of no use to the next owner at most.

21
00:00:48,710 --> 00:00:50,110
So you are going to go to Sister Yaqin’s parents’ house

22
00:00:50,110 --> 00:00:51,110
Get a weapon for self-defense

23
00:00:51,430 --> 00:00:52,830
Uncle Daya used to be the captain of the Ming army

24
00:00:52,830 --> 00:00:53,910
Now he is the captain of the bad team

25
00:00:54,150 --> 00:00:55,190
She must have a good guy on her hands

26
00:00:55,310 --> 00:00:56,350
Can your elder brother agree?

27
00:00:56,710 --> 00:00:58,430
After all, when Jianguo divorced you,

28
00:00:58,590 --> 00:00:59,830
She almost killed Jianguo with a gun

29
00:00:59,990 --> 00:01:00,950
I'll go tell my brother

30
00:01:01,590 --> 00:01:02,670
You bring some good things over there

31
00:01:02,910 --> 00:01:04,990
Sister Yaqin, please say something nice to Zhang Jianguo, I know.

32
00:01:17,100 --> 00:01:18,300
By the way, there's this

33
00:01:18,820 --> 00:01:20,380
You got a lot of good stuff

34
00:01:20,780 --> 00:01:22,220
I won’t bring this bucket of Buddha’s hands with me, right?
